OL,3,GNEWSA'Perpetual trauma' after model
OL,4,Atrain collection thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has described "living through
OL,7,Fa perpetual trauma" following the
OL,8,Fthefts of a model steam train
OL,9,Fcollection and two vintage motorcycles
OL,10,Ffrom the former home of their
OL,11,F93-year-old father.
OL,13,FThames Valley Police said the thefts
OL,14,Fhad taken place at an unoccupied
OL,15,Faddress in Appleton, Oxfordshire,
OL,16,Fbetween 28 April and 6 May 2026.
OL,18,FFour men from Oxford have been
OL,19,Fconvicted in connection with the
OL,20,Fburglaries, with three handed suspended
OL,21,Fprison sentences.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
